ess of the current owner."},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby disabling any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"unstakeAndWithdraw(uint256,uint256,address)":{"params":{"conicLpAmount":"Amount of LP tokens to burn","minUnderlyingReceived":"Minimum amount of underlying to redeem This should always be set to a reasonable value (e.g. 2%), otherwise the user withdrawing could be forced into paying a withdrawal penalty fee by another user"},"returns":{"_0":"uint256 Total underlying withdrawn"}},"usdExchangeRate()":{"details":"This is using the cached total underlying value, so is not precisely accurate."},"withdraw(uint256,uint256,address)":{"params":{"conicLpAmount":"Amount of LP tokens to burn","minUnderlyingReceived":"Minimum amount of underlying to redeem This should always be set to a reasonable value (e.g. 2%), otherwise the user withdrawing could be forced into paying a withdrawal penalty fee by another user"},"returns":{"_0":"uint256 Total underlying withdrawn"}}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"cachedTotalUnderlying()":{"notice":"same as `totalUnderlying` but returns a cached version that might be slightly outdated if oracle prices have changed"},"deposit(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Deposit underlying"},"deposit(uint256,uint256,bool)":{"notice":"Deposit underlying"},"depositFor(address,uint256,uint256,bool)":{"notice":"Deposit underlying on behalf of someone"},"emergencyRebalancingRewardsFactor()":{"notice":"The factor by which the rebalancing reward is multiplied when a pool is depegged"},"exchangeRate()":{"notice":"Get current exchange rate for the pool's LP token to the u